  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Note that the line is parallel to the plane, hence the image of the line will be a parallel line.</p><p>Now,&nbsp; let the image of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So the required equation is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
